{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1250\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Calibri;}}\f0\fs22 Moser Slovakia s. r. o.\par Twin City C, Mlynsk\u233? nivy 12, 821 09 Bratislava\par I\u268?O 47 556 210 \u183? DI\u268? 2022468911 \u183? I\u268? DPH SK2022468911\par \par travel policy\par 1. 3. 2026\par \par Travel policy (OPS-TVL)\par \par Issuer: Moser Slovakia s. r. o. \u183? I\u268?O 47 556 210 \u183? Twin City C, Mlynsk\u233? nivy 12, 821 09 Bratislava\par \par Effective: 9 March 2026  \par Owner: Workplace, Moser Slovakia s. r. o.\par \par Book flights and hotels through the designated corporate agency. Economy is the default for any flight under 6 hours, including Vienna and Budapest departures. Business class needs CFO approval.\par \par Domestic and foreign travel is settled under the Travel Compensation Act (z\u225?kon \u269?. 283/2002 Z. z.): the meal allowance follows the current Ministry of Labour measure, and a foreign trip uses the per-country rate for the day.\par \par Private travel combined with a business trip must be priced as a comparison screenshot attached to the ticket. Rental cars are compact or midsize only; counter GPS and insurance add-ons are not reimbursable where corporate cover already applies.\par \par \par Mgr. Zuzana Kr\u225?likov\u225?, People Operations / Compliance}